{"book":6,"chapter":16,"context":{"chapter":16,"title":"Ephraim's Share","summary":"The descendants of Joseph receive their lot, and the borders of Ephraim are traced. The Canaanites of Gezer are not driven out but put to forced labor.","background":"Joseph received a double share because Jacob had adopted Joseph's sons, Ephraim and Manasseh, as his own (Genesis 48:5). Ephraim's land lay in the central hill country north of Benjamin. Gezer stayed Canaanite until an Egyptian pharaoh captured it and gave it as a dowry to his daughter, Solomon's wife (1 Kings 9:16).","customs":[{"term":"Under tribute","verses":"16:10","note":"Forced labor. Instead of driving the Canaanites out, Ephraim made them work for them."}],"watchFor":["Ephraim, the younger son, is placed before his older brother Manasseh, as Jacob had done (Genesis 48:19-20).","The chapter ends with an unfinished task (v. 10)."],"connections":["Genesis 48:5","Genesis 48:19-20","Judges 1:29","1 Kings 9:16"]},"verses":{"1":{"w":[["וַיֵּצֵא","vaiyetze'","H3318","Hc/Vqw3ms","and it went out"],["הַגּוֹרָל","hagoral","H1486","HTd/Ncmsa","the lot"],["לִבְנֵי","livnei","H1121","HR/Ncmpc","of [the] descendants of"],["יוֹסֵף","yosef","H3130","HNpm","Joseph"],["מִיַּרְדֵּן","miyarden","H3383","HR/Npl","from [the] Jordan"],["יְרִיחוֹ","yericho","H3405","HNpl","of Jericho"],["לְמֵי","lemei","H4325","HR/Ncmpc","to [the] waters of"],["יְרִיחוֹ","yericho","H3405","HNpl","Jericho"],["מִזְרָחָה","mizrachah","H4217","HNcmsa/Sd","east -ward"],["הַמִּדְבָּר","hamidbar","H4057","HTd/Ncmsa","the wilderness"],["עֹלֶה","'oleh","H5927","HVqrmsa","going up"],["מִירִיחוֹ","miricho","H3405","HR/Npl","from Jericho"],["בָּהָר","bahar","H2022","HRd/Ncmsa","in the hill country"],["בֵּית","beit-","H1008","HNpl","Beth-"],["אֵל","'el","H1008","HNpl","-el"]],"x":[[6018012,6018012,5],[6008015,6008015,4],[12002019,12002021,3]],"xn":3},"2":{"w":[["וְיָצָא","veyatza'","H3318","Hc/Vqq3ms","and it goes out"],["מִבֵּית","mibeit-","H1008","HR/Npl","from Be