sraelites (Josh. 3:16).","verses":58,"v":[1,7]},{"id":"jordan_653","name":"Jordan","kind":"Water (River)","lat":33.18645,"lon":35.61916,"summary":"But besides these two historical fountains there is a third, called the Hasbany, which rises in the bottom of a valley at the western base of Hermon, 12 miles north of Tell-el-Kady.","verses":177,"v":[1,7]},{"id":"ataroth_114","name":"Ataroth","kind":"City","lat":31.85892,"lon":35.12831,"summary":"A town on the border of Ephraim and Benjamin (Josh. 16:2, 7), called also Ataroth-adar (16:5).","verses":2,"v":[2,7]},{"id":"luz_737","name":"Luz","kind":"City","lat":31.93054,"lon":35.22103,"summary":"The ancient name of a royal Canaanitish city near the site of Bethel (Gen. 28:19; 35:6), on the border of Benjamin (Josh. 18:13).","verses":6,"v":[2]},{"id":"beth-horon_733","name":"Beth-horon","kind":"City","lat":31.87893,"lon":35.12357,"summary":"House of the hollow, or of the cavern, the name of two towns or villages (2 Chr. 8:5; 1 Chr. 7:24) in the territory of Ephraim, on the way from Jerusalem to Joppa.","verses":4,"v":[3]},{"id":"gezer_463","name":"Gezer","kind":"City","lat":31.85958,"lon":34.92048,"summary":"A precipice, an ancient royal Canaanitish city (Josh. 10:33; 12:12). It was allotted with its suburbs to the Kohathite Levites (21:21; 1 Chr. 6:67).","verses":14,"v":[3,10]},{"id":"west-manasseh_1291","name":"West Manasseh","kind":"Region","lat":32.48192,"lon":35.31006,"summary":"Added from Digital Manna places-1269 (LPF sync 2026-10-13)","verses":19,"v":[4,9]},{"id":"ataroth-addar_115","name":"Ataroth-addar","kind":"","lat":31.85892,"lon":35.12831,"summary":"","verses":1,"v":[5]},{"id":"upper_beth-horon_1188","name":"Upper Beth-horon","kind":"","lat":31.85892,"lon":35.12831,"summary":"","verses":1,"v":[5]},{"id":"janoah_621","name":"Janoah","kind":"City","lat":33.26025,"lon":35.30291,"summary":"A town on the north-eastern border of Ephraim, in the Jordan valley (Josh. 16:6, 7).","verses":2,"v":[6,7]},{"id":"michmethath_794","name":"Michmethath","kind":"City","lat":32.18333,"lon":35.28333,"summary":"Hiding-place, a town in the northern border of Ephraim and Manasseh, and not far west of Jordan (Josh. 16:6; 17:7).","verses":2,"v":[6]},{"id":"taanath-shiloh_1125","name":"Taanath-shiloh","kind":"","lat":32.15,"lon":35.38333,"summary":"Approach to Shiloh, a place on the border of Ephraim (Josh. 16:6), probably the modern T’ana, a ruin 7 miles south-east of Shechem, on the ridge east of the Mukhnah plain.","verses":1,"v":[6]},{"id":"naarah_867","name":"Naarah","kind":"City","lat":31.94952,"lon":35.45873,"summary":"Girl, a town on the boundary between Ephraim and Benjamin (Josh. 16:7), not far probably from Jericho, to the north (1 Chr. 7:28).","verses":1,"v":[7]},{"id":"kanah_666","name":"Kanah","kind":"Water (River)","lat":32.13822,"lon":35.03897,"summary":"A stream forming the boundary between Ephraim and Manasseh, from the Mediterranean eastward to Tappuah (Josh. 16:8). It has been identified with the sedgy streams that constitute the Wady Talaik, which enters the sea between Joppa and Caesarea.","verses":2,"v":[8]},{"id":"tappuah_1136","name":"Tappuah","kind":"City","lat":32.11667,"lon":35.23333,"summary":"A town on the border of Ephraim (Josh. 16:8).","verses":3,"v":[8]}],"events":[],"traditions":[],"sources":["JFB","MHCC","Wesley"],"tags":{"bsb":[[1486,1486,1121,1121,1121,3130,3130,3318,3383,3383,3383,3405,3405,4325,4325,4325,3405,3405,4217,4217,4217,4057,4057,4057,5927,5927,5927,3405,3405,2022,2022,2022,2022,1008,1008],[3318,3318,3318,1008,1008,3870,3870,3870,5674,5674,413,1366,1366,757,757,757,5852,5852],[3381,3381,3381,3220,413,1366,1366,3311,3311,3311,5704,1366,1366,1366,1366,1032,8481,1032,5704,5704,5704,1507,1961,1961,1961,3220,3220,3220],[669,669,4519,4519,1121,1121,3130,3130,5157,5157,5157],[1961,1961,1366,1366,1121,1121,1121,669,669,4940,4940,4940,1366,1366,5159,5159,5159,5853,5853,5853,4217,4217,4217,5945,5945,1032],[3318,3318,3318,3220,3220,4366,4366,6828,6828,6828,13